     bb84/etsi014_client_lib.js   ETSI GS QKD 014 client library
     hal/hardware_interface.py    hardware abstraction interface
     hal/qrng_interface.py        QRNG abstraction interface
     hal/types.py                 shared HAL data types
     hal/transport.py             HAL transport layer
     hal/detector_profile.py      detector-profile loader (config.json schema)
     config.json                  detector-profile configuration

